  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_001 (multimodal, singleprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, weighted fusion) achieves 0.5318 accuracy. Uncertainty remains about the impact of image encoder choice (imagenet_vit_l vs resnet50) on performance. This experiment tests whether switching to resnet50 improves accuracy while keeping other parameters identical, isolating the effect of the image encoder. It balances exploration of critical design choices with minimal changes, providing direct evidence about a key component."
